<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday that Checkpoint Systmes Inc, Dallas Semiconductor Corp and Apria Healthcare Group Inc were unavailable for trading for news.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA was also unavailable for trading, the NYSE said.</p>
